<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>逐月統計年報 {{ station.name_zh }} {{ roc_year }}年</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@700&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --ink:      #1D3557;
  --steel:    #457B9D;
  --stripe:   #F8F9FA;
  --hairline: #C9D2D8;
}

@page {
  size: A4 landscape;
  margin: 10mm 12mm 14mm;
  @bottom-right {
    content: "{{ station.name_zh }}潮位站　Tidal Observation Data Annual Report {{ year }}";
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 6px;
    color: #6c757d;
    vertical-align: bottom;
    padding-bottom: 3mm;
  }
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', '微軟正黑體', sans-serif;
  font-size: 8pt;
  color: #212529;
}

/* ── 頁首 ── */
.report-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  border-bottom: 2pt solid var(--ink);
  padding-bottom: 3mm;
  margin-bottom: 3mm;
}
.header-side {
  font-size: 7.5pt;
  color: #444;
  line-height: 1.85;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.header-side.right { text-align: right; }
.header-center { text-align: center; flex: 1; padding: 0 6mm; }
.h-title-main {
  font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', serif;
  font-size: 14pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--ink);
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}
.h-title-sub { font-size: 9pt; color: var(--steel); margin-top: 1mm; }
.h-datum     { font-size: 7pt; color: #555; margin-top: 2mm; line-height: 1.6; }

/* ── 資料表 ── */
table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  table-layout: fixed;
}

/* 欄寬（21 欄合計 ≈ 271mm，A4 landscape 可用寬約 273mm） */
col.c-month { width: 16mm; }
col.c-mwl   { width: 12mm; }
col.c-no    { width: 11mm; }
col.c-std   { width: 14mm; } /* MHWL MLWL MHAT MLAT HAT LAT */
col.c-eday  { width:  9mm; } /* HHWL/LLWL 日 */
col.c-elun  { width: 15mm; } /* HHWL/LLWL 農曆日 */
col.c-etm   { width: 12mm; } /* HHWL/LLWL 時間 */
col.c-eht   { width: 12mm; } /* HHWL/LLWL 潮高 */
col.c-diff  { width: 13mm; } /* MR MAR MATR MTR */

thead th {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 6.5pt;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-align: center;
  vertical-align: middle;
  padding: 2.5px 1px;
  border: 0.5pt solid #2a4a6b;
  line-height: 1.35;
}
/* 群組標題（HHWL / LLWL）略深 */
thead th.group-header { background: #2a4a6b; font-size: 7pt; }

tbody td {
  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
  font-size: 7.5pt;
  text-align: center;
  vertical-align: middle;
  padding: 2.5px 1px;
  border: 0.5pt solid var(--hairline);
  line-height: 1.2;
}
tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--stripe); }

td.month-cell {
  font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
  font-size: 7pt;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--ink);
}

/* QC='%' 列：數值後有 *，整列文字轉灰 */
tr.qc-low td { color: #6c757d; }

/* 年度列 */
tr.annual-row td {
  background: #DDE3E9 !important;
  font-weight: 700;
  border-top: 1.5pt solid var(--ink);
}
tr.annual-row td.month-cell { color: var(--ink); }

/* ── 備註 ── */
.footnote {
  margin-top: 3mm;
  font-size: 7pt;
  color: #6c757d;
  line-height: 1.85;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="report-header">
  <div class="header-side left">
    測站 (Station)：{{ station.name_zh }}潮位站 {{ station.name_en }}<br>
    位置 (Location)：{{ station.lat }} {{ station.lon }}{% if station.location_desc %} {{ station.location_desc }}{% endif %}<br>
    潮高差單位 (Unit)：公分 / cm
  </div>

  <div class="header-center">
    <div class="h-title-main">交通部中央氣象署逐月潮位統計年報表</div>
    <div class="h-title-sub">Annual Summary of Tidal Statistics</div>
    <div class="h-datum">
      潮高基準 (Datum)：相對臺灣高程基準 (TaiWan Vertical Datum 2001，TWVD2001) 基隆海平面。
      {% if station.benchmark_id %}潮高參考水準點：編號{{ station.benchmark_id }}{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="header-side right">
    民國{{ roc_year }}年　西元{{ year }}<br>
    資料來源 (sponsor)：中央氣象署<br>
    測站代碼：{{ stid }}
  </div>
</header>

<table>
  <colgroup>
    <col class="c-month">
    <col class="c-mwl">
    <col class="c-no">
    <col class="c-std"><!-- MHWL -->
    <col class="c-std"><!-- MLWL -->
    <col class="c-std"><!-- MHAT -->
    <col class="c-std"><!-- MLAT -->
    <col class="c-std"><!-- HAT -->
    <col class="c-std"><!-- LAT -->
    <col class="c-eday"><col class="c-elun"><col class="c-etm"><col class="c-eht"><!-- HHWL group -->
    <col class="c-eday"><col class="c-elun"><col class="c-etm"><col class="c-eht"><!-- LLWL group -->
    <col class="c-diff"><!-- MR -->
    <col class="c-diff"><!-- MAR -->
    <col class="c-diff"><!-- MATR -->
    <col class="c-diff"><!-- MTR -->
  </colgroup>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th rowspan="2">月份<br>Month</th>
      <th rowspan="2">平均<br>潮位<br>MWL</th>
      <th rowspan="2">高低<br>潮次<br>數<br>No</th>
      <th rowspan="2">平均<br>高潮位<br>MHWL</th>
      <th rowspan="2">平均<br>低潮位<br>MLWL</th>
      <th rowspan="2">平均天<br>文高潮<br>位 MHAT</th>
      <th rowspan="2">平均天<br>文低潮<br>位 MLAT</th>
      <th rowspan="2">最高<br>天文潮<br>HAT</th>
      <th rowspan="2">最低<br>天文潮<br>LAT</th>
      <th colspan="4" class="group-header">最高高潮位 HHWL</th>
      <th colspan="4" class="group-header">最低低潮位 LLWL</th>
      <th rowspan="2">平均<br>潮差<br>MR</th>
      <th rowspan="2">平均天<br>文潮差<br>MAR</th>
      <th rowspan="2">最大天<br>文潮差<br>MATR</th>
      <th rowspan="2">最大<br>潮差<br>MTR</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>日</th><th>農曆日</th><th>時間</th><th>潮高</th>
      <th>日</th><th>農曆日</th><th>時間</th><th>潮高</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for row in monthly_rows %}
    <tr{% if row.qc == '%' %} class="qc-low"{% endif %}>
      <td class="month-cell">
        {{ row.month_zh }}<br>
        <span style="font-size:6pt;color:#888">{{ row.month_en }}</span>
      </td>
      <td>{{ row.MWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.NO }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.MHWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.MLWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.MHAT }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.MLAT }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.HAT }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.LAT }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.HHWL_day }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.HHWL_lunar }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.HHWL_time }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.HHWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.LLWL_day }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.LLWL_lunar }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.LLWL_time }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.LLWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.MR }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.MAR }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.MATR }}</td>
      <td>{{ row.MTR }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    {% if annual_row %}
    <tr class="annual-row">
      <td class="month-cell">
        年度<br>
        <span style="font-size:6pt">Annual</span>
      </td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.MWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.NO }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.MHWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.MLWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.MHAT }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.MLAT }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.HAT }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.LAT }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.HHWL_day }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.HHWL_lunar }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.HHWL_time }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.HHWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.LLWL_day }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.LLWL_lunar }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.LLWL_time }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.LLWL }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.MR }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.MAR }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.MATR }}</td>
      <td>{{ annual_row.MTR }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endif %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="footnote">
  1. 空白表示沒有觀測或儀器故障。<br>
  2. ＊表示該月觀測次數少於應測次數 2/3，統計值可能不具代表性。
</div>

</body>
</html>